  "notes": [
    "Place words come after the noun, with के: बैंक के बगल में (next to the bank), बैंक के सामने (opposite the bank), बैंक के पीछे (behind the bank).",
    "सामने means \"facing\": opposite, or in front of. के आगे is \"in front of\" when you mean on the near side.",
    "दवाई की दुकान is a chemist. Many people just say केमिस्ट or मेडिकल स्टोर.",
    "सुनिए gets a stranger's attention politely. With a young person, भैया or दीदी works too."
  ]
